{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n 最近握力が弱って来ているのか\n 携帯をよく落とします。\n 絶賛生まれて初めてバキバキ画面の携帯\n 使用中です。\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n 日曜日は個別握手会でしたー！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NX4SWS7Q1BK0KDSEGFAGP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 2部👗with迫りくる高瀬愛奈\n お正月のセールで手に入れた\n ビスチェを着ました！\n ビスチェ好きなんです。ビスチェ。\n \n あれ？ビスチェで合ってますよね？\n \n このビスチェのポイントは\n 30秒で購入に至ったというところです🧞‍♀️\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NX63J2ZTCM3Z2K7619KYZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 髪型はおんぷちゃんちっくにしました！\n 最初は普通にストレートでおろしてたんですけど\n なんか物足りなくて自分でピッて結びました\n っていう話です。🚲\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NX7EKARD4P2H4XHB7GMCA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 4部と5部👗\n これ実はツナギ？になっています！\n あまりしない服装をしてみました。\n \n 髪切ったよーていうポーザ\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NX8KXZZTN8JA019V6C4PK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 犬おった🐕\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NX9KT3FF9QKZ134N1KS2A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ナガハマもおった🧚‍♀️\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NXAJ6MD97AP5TNSRPZZH3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NXBK740XKJS2HS9ZNHW9Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NXCH7CZ44VNSTNYW20R3P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NXE55TP55KC80TQFS8B26","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1NXF5EE8X2B4GGHNH1X30S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n お花ありがとうございます💐\n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}